WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:07.498
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Check AI Answers: Facts and Mistakes.

2
00:00:07.798 --> 00:00:12.587
Find and avoid wrong answers from AI. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:13.583 --> 00:00:21.152
Step one. AI can be confidently wrong. Here it says Siem Reap is the capital of Cambodia. That is a mistake.

4
00:00:22.150 --> 00:00:27.278
Step two. Ask for the source. Be extra careful with names, dates and numbers.

5
00:00:28.283 --> 00:00:33.850
Step three. Check with a trusted source, such as an official website, a book or your teacher.

6
00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:41.083
Step four. Decide. Use only information you have checked. This keeps your work honest and correct.

7
00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:45.943
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:46.243 --> 00:00:49.380
Ask AI three factual questions.

9
00:00:49.680 --> 00:00:52.377
Check each answer on a trusted website.

10
00:00:52.677 --> 00:00:54.757
Write down which answers were wrong.

11
00:00:55.057 --> 00:00:55.977
Well done!

